WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.127
News Reporter:
Tonight's top story, Hurricane
Katrina

00:00:02.127 --> 00:00:04.796
News Reporter:
could be one of the biggest
storms to ever hit this country.

00:00:08.383 --> 00:00:12.596
George Bush:
We cannot stress enough the
danger this hurricane poses to gulf coast communities.

00:00:17.392 --> 00:00:18.185
♪♪

00:00:18.185 --> 00:00:18.936
Nurse:
We need help.

00:00:19.186 --> 00:00:21.146
Nurse:
We're running out of food
and water.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.315
Nurse:
We can't take it much longer. 

00:00:23.732 --> 00:00:26.652
Dr. Anna Pou
There's nothing else to do for
them.

00:00:26.652 --> 00:00:28.612
Except to make them comfortable.

00:00:32.407 --> 00:00:33.742
Dr. Anna Pou:
Every single one of us

00:00:34.451 --> 00:00:35.869
Dr. Anna Pou:
did everything we could.

00:00:36.495 --> 00:00:41.375
Dr. Anna Pou:
And everybody in that hospital
was treated with dignity.

00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:43.877
State Attorney:
They found 45 dead bodies.

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:45.379
State Attorney:
Now does that make any sense to
you?

00:00:45.754 --> 00:00:47.589
State Attorney:
45 dead patients.

00:00:49.132 --> 00:00:52.594
Given the conditions, maybe 45
patients succumbed.

00:00:52.594 --> 00:00:54.429
Maybe they didn't.

